{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/968a0c07035bbf4440436f13caab569a.avif?t=1757426331\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc A Brand-New Sensation in Rhythm Action, Conducted by Thighs! \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master simple controls to command a pair of lovely thighs and vanquish the souls approaching from the back of the screen! Catch and purify souls to the upbeat rhythm... &quot;MOMO Crash&quot; is an exhilarating rhythm game with a novel theme like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcPersonalities on Full Blast! Three &quot;Thigh Warriors&quot; Await!\u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of chaos, they are the &quot;Thigh-Warriors,&quot; the sole wielders of the power of purification. Look forward to their cute and powerful exploits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/0e999f705b62f427bd34007e7845c49d.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/0e999f705b62f427bd34007e7845c49d.webp?t=1757426331\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Daia (The Confident and Unstoppable Eternal Diamond High-Teen)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fascinate, Pierce, Dominate\u2014\u2014The Perfectly Self-Produced Thighs&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daia, the &quot;Jewel Girl&quot; who shines with confidence and style! To her, &quot;KAWAII&quot; (cuteness) is justice and the ultimate form of self-expression. Wielding her perfectly toned &quot;Thighs&quot; as weapons, she fights and dazzles day in and day out to paint the world in her unique vision of &quot;KAWAII&quot;! Her goal: to become the president of the No.1 brand. No one can stop her ambition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/dcbeb8682f0276d9e0c882ebcbc201dd.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/dcbeb8682f0276d9e0c882ebcbc201dd.webp?t=1757426331\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9c\u00a0Seika\u00a0(The Bashful, Heart-Fluttering, Philanthropic Sister with a Locked-Up Heart)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wanting to be saved, wanting to save\u2014\u2014Thighs like a Cage of Love Swirling Within&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seika is a shy sister torn between her duties in her sacred role and her earnest desire to be needed by someone. Hidden beneath her modest sister's attire, her &quot;Thighs&quot; hold a benevolent power to heal the world, and a &quot;Cage of Love&quot; concealing passions so fierce they sometimes threaten to imprison her. With those legs, what will she grasp? World peace, or her own small measure of happiness\u2014\u2014?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/fb759e0d7d8e464b80f8b40c4aef6a77.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/fb759e0d7d8e464b80f8b40c4aef6a77.webp?t=1757426331\" class=\"bb_img\" width=250 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1e\u00a0Hikaru\u00a0(The Wild, Sparkling, Optimistic Traveler with an Explosive Smile)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zero Guilt in Destruction\u2014\u2014The Naive Hyper-Crush Thighs&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want to make everyone smile!&quot; With this pure wish as her sole guide, the innocent traveler Hikaru journeys the world! To find her missing sister, she heroically CRUSHES any obstacle with her prized &quot;Reinforced Thighs&quot;! Bright as the sun, her destructive power comes with absolutely no ill-will or guilt, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/cfc1f123d09781bd598cbb6b020aa897.avif?t=1757426331\" width=1138 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc Anyone Can Play! A Deep Dive into the Core Gameplay! \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic controls consist of just two actions: <strong>&quot;Catch&quot; and &quot;Kick&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of targets, each with different characteristics, will fly towards you in time with the rhythm. Deal with each of them precisely with the right action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/d1a0d6515bdd131f1820a734e2eaeb1f.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/d1a0d6515bdd131f1820a734e2eaeb1f.webm?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/d1a0d6515bdd131f1820a734e2eaeb1f.mp4?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>\ud83d\udc7b Flying &quot;Souls&quot;</strong> should be gently caught and held between the thighs <br>at the right moment to be purified!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/b655f369c603f26f1855b1b75e0e6434.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/b655f369c603f26f1855b1b75e0e6434.webm?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/b655f369c603f26f1855b1b75e0e6434.mp4?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udda0 But the <strong>&quot;Viruses&quot; that sometimes sneak in</strong> must be repelled with <br>a sharp Kick &amp; Crush of the thighs to the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/ed0ddcbe9f0b9b347f706e120b5d16ff.poster.avif?t=1757426331\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/ed0ddcbe9f0b9b347f706e120b5d16ff.webm?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/ed0ddcbe9f0b9b347f706e120b5d16ff.mp4?t=1757426331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc08 And watch out for the <strong>cute &quot;Cats&quot; that occasionally appear</strong>...<br>you must never attack them by mistake!<br>Gently offer them your lap and let them rest until they're satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Catch to Purify + Kick to Destroy + And Occasionally, Pet a Cat (?)&quot; \u2014 This simple, yet profound, set of actions says it all...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/extras/4f545f038a50831b492266b8574d5727.avif?t=1757426331\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bc From the Creators, With All Our Love and... &quot;Thighs&quot; \u25bc</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;MOMO Crash&quot;</strong> is a work born from the pure desire of creators to &quot;draw cute girls,&quot; the shared feeling of the development team that &quot;Thighs are just the best, aren't they...!&quot;, and the raw passion to &quot;create the world's most fun rhythm game, beyond all reason!&quot; It is a crystal of our love and obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the thighs we can muster\u2014for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3077570?t=1757426331","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/8d715970aa3611d27a2924c161496740ba809899/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757426331","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077570/e0476e1185e94bac7176c2bf75e8cbdf0846467e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757426331","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s